# Comic text, never committed. This repo is public, and a prelim groups file
# holds the verbatim dialogue of an in-copyright Barks story -- the same
# material the OCR corpus deliberately keeps in a private repo. Ignored by
# pattern rather than by name so a stray copy cannot slip in under `git add .`.
*-groups.json
ocr-groups-example.json

# Third-party tool download, not a dependency of anything here.
epubcheck-*.zip

